      "text": "$$\\begin{gathered}V_{12}(x) = \\mathbb{E}\\!\\left[\\min\\{c_{12}^\\top x_{12} + \\beta \\cdot V_1(x_{12})\\}\\right]\\\\[4pt]\\text{where:}\\\\\\beta \\in (0, 1) = \\text{discount factor}\\\\V_1 \\text{ appears on RHS of }V_{12} \\text{ (cycle!)}\\\\\\text{Solved via fixed-point iteration}\\end{gathered}$$",
